Description: cham3 desktop plus the curated Debian 13 application suite (M1)
 Metapackage for the cham3 M1 desktop image. It installs cham3-desktop and the
 curated suite that is available from Debian 13 (trixie): nmap with Zenmap,
 masscan, bind9-dnsutils, whois, Wireshark and tshark, tcpdump, nethogs,
 iftop, sqlmap, nikto, ffuf, gobuster, aircrack-ng, binwalk, exiftool,
 hashcat, john, hydra and the Tor Browser launcher. nikto comes from the
 Debian non-free archive area and torbrowser-launcher from contrib.
 .
 Planned, pending source review (documented gaps, NOT installed by this
 package). The following requested tools are not available in Debian 13
 (trixie), or need a separately reviewed source, and are not dependencies:
 LibreWolf, ghidra, metasploit-framework, exploitdb (searchsploit), zaproxy
 (OWASP ZAP), wpscan, cutter, radare2, rizin, mitmproxy, amass; no
 external package source is configured. Until they are resolved the image has
 no disassembler or decompiler and no mitmproxy.
 .
 Package presence is not a safety or isolation claim. Installing this
 metapackage does not sandbox any tool, apply a permission contract or enforce
 a network mode; those features do not exist in M1.
